                  "value": "17",
                  "label": "Own their templates",
                  "body": "Each defines its own `renderParameterTemplates`."
                },
                {
                  "value": "5",
                  "label": "Escape modes",
                  "body": "`markdown`, `slack`, `json`, `html`, and `none`."
