              "lede": "Code, agents, and every channel meet at one typed document."
            },
            {
              "type": "slideList",
              "items": [
                {
                  "term": "degrades",
                  "body": "Three renderers are mandatory, so every composition has a text and a Markdown form."
                },
                {
                  "term": "one schema",
                  "body": "The JSON Schema the agent reads is projected from the Zod schema that validates."
                },
                {
                  "term": "trust line",
                  "body": "Agents author layout only; the host keeps data, auth, and side effects."
                },
                {
                  "term": "error copy",
                  "body": "Errors are written for a model to repair from, and evals measure it."
                },
                {
                  "term": "reachable CSS",
                  "body": "HTML and images carry only the styles a render reached."
                }
              ]
            }
